  "summary": "Profile namespace restriction bypass in github.com/projectsveltos/addon-controller",
  "details": "ProfileReconciler does not restrict the namespace of spec.helmCharts[].valuesFrom, spec.patchesFrom, or spec.templateResourceRefs to the Profile's own namespace when copying a namespace-scoped Profile into a ClusterSummary. A user permitted to create Profiles in one namespace can read ConfigMaps, Secrets, and other resources from arbitrary namespaces in the management cluster.",
